  <h1>About ImgFeel</h1>
  <p class="last-updated"><strong>Last Updated:</strong> August 16, 2026</p>

  <h2>1. What is ImgFeel?</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>ImgFeel</strong> (<a href="https://imgfeel.com/">https://imgfeel.com/</a>) is a lightweight, modern suite of browser-based image utility tools engineered for speed, simplicity, and uncompromising user privacy.
  </p>
  <p>
    Whether you need to resize a photo for a government application portal, convert next-gen WebP or Apple HEIC files into universal JPG format, adjust physical dimensions in centimeters or millimeters, or compress files down to exact kilobyte targets, ImgFeel delivers precise results in seconds without requiring software downloads, account sign-ups, or subscriptions.
  </p>

  <h2>2. The Problem We Solve</h2>
  <p>
    Traditional online image tools often force users to upload their private photos, ID documents, and signature scans to remote servers. This introduces significant drawbacks:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Privacy Risks:</strong> Sensitive personal documents, passport photos, and family memories travel across the internet and may be stored on third-party servers.</li>
    <li><strong>Slow Upload Speeds:</strong> Uploading large multi-megabyte images over slow or mobile internet connections wastes valuable time and bandwidth.</li>
    <li><strong>Clunky Barriers:</strong> Many platforms require registrations, impose watermarks, enforce daily conversion limits, or demand paid subscriptions for basic features.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    ImgFeel eliminates these obstacles entirely by leveraging modern web standards to process your images directly on your own device.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Privacy-First, Client-Side Architecture</h2>
  <p>
    At ImgFeel, <strong>privacy by design</strong> is our foundational principle:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>100% Local Execution:</strong> Our algorithms run inside your device's browser using the HTML5 Canvas API, WebAssembly (WASM), and background Web Workers.</li>
    <li><strong>No Server Transmission:</strong> Your image files never leave your phone, tablet, or computer. Our servers never receive, inspect, or store your photos.</li>
    <li><strong>Instant Memory Cleanup:</strong> The moment you close the tab or upload a new photo, all previous data in browser memory is immediately released.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Our Tool Suite</h2>
  <p>ImgFeel offers an expanding collection of purpose-built image tools, including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Image Resizer & Compressor:</strong> Resize by exact pixel dimensions, percentage scale, or target KB/MB file size with custom format outputs (JPG, PNG, WebP, AVIF).</li>
    <li><strong>WebP to JPG/PNG Converter:</strong> Convert Google WebP files into universal JPG or transparent PNG images with lossless precision.</li>
    <li><strong>HEIC to JPG Converter:</strong> Fast, in-browser decoding of Apple iPhone HEIC/HEIF photos to JPG with single and batch ZIP download options.</li>
    <li><strong>CM / MM Image Resizer:</strong> Convert physical print measurements (cm and mm) to exact pixel counts based on configurable DPI/PPI settings (72, 150, 300 DPI).</li>
    <li><strong>SSC & Government Exam Resizer:</strong> Accurate presets and live validation checklists for official Staff Selection Commission exam photos (20–50 KB) and signatures (10–20 KB).</li>
    <li><strong>PAN Card Image Resizer:</strong> Dedicated dimension and KB optimizer for NSDL and UTIITSL PAN card portal requirements.</li>
    <li><strong>Social Media Resizers:</strong> Square 1:1 circle-safe avatar resizer for WhatsApp profile pictures (DP) and safe-zone resizer for YouTube channel banners (2560×1440).</li>
    <li><strong>Developer Utilities:</strong> Fast client-side converters for Image to Base64 strings and Image to Data URI code snippets.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Commitment to Performance & Accessibility</h2>
  <p>
    We design every page and tool with a mobile-first philosophy:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Blazing Fast Load Times:</strong> Zero heavy external frameworks, zero bloat, and self-hosted optimized typography.</li>
    <li><strong>Universal Multilingual Support:</strong> Our core homepage and tools are accessible across 8 of the world's most spoken languages.</li>
    <li><strong>Clean, Accessible Interface:</strong> High-contrast typography, intuitive controls, and responsive touch targets for phones, tablets, and desktops alike.</li>
  </ul>

